  "solution": {
    "text": "Ozone is allotropic form of oxygen and is of higher energy (by $68 \\mathrm{~K}$ Cal mol $^{-1}$ ) than $\\mathrm{O}_{2}$. Hence it can not be taken as the reference in standard state."
